# A Fly carrier for the rest of the chain and a second Pokemon for Tate & Liza's double battle: a Swellow at slot 2
# (party SPECIES LEVEL ITEM appends), Fly as a player teaches it (HM02 from milestone 26). Lunatone/Solrock
# (pokeruby gTrainerParty_TateAndLiza: LUNATONE 42, SOLROCK 42): the lead's Surf at lv 50 carries it.
party SPECIES_SWELLOW 45 ITEM_NONE
party-move 2 0 MOVE_FLY
party-level 0 50
